ocalized_name": "b"}, {"widget": {"name": "expression"}, "name": "expression", "label": "expression", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "expression"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 131, "type": "ComfyMathExpression", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.29.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ComfyMathExpression"}, "order": 19}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [279], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["[PROMPT TYPE]\nMiniMax H3 reference-to-video. Two character reference sheets, no other references. Single continuous 5-second shot, cinematic wuxia live-action realism.\n\n[REFERENCE USE]\nImage1: sole identity reference for the male fighter — the black-robed young man in the turnaround sheet: exact face, dark branching seal mark on the forehead center, faint dark crack lines on cheek and neck, long loose black hair half-tied with strands over the face, layered all-black hanfu robe with sheer gauze sleeves, wide dark waist sash, black boots.\nImage2: sole identity reference for the female fighter — the teal-robed young woman in the turnaround sheet: exact face, high updo with golden floral hairpins and dangling pearl ornaments, long black hair down the back, deep teal-green layered hanfu with gold-embroidered dark outer coat and red edging, ornate waist belt, pleated skirt.\nEach image governs one character only; neither character borrows traits from the other's sheet.\n\n[IDENTITY AND CONTINUITY LOCKS]\nThe man keeps Image1's face, forehead seal mark, crack lines, hairstyle and all-black robe in every frame; the woman keeps Image2's face, updo, hairpins and teal-green gold-embroidered robe in every frame; weapons stay assigned — man: black straight sword; woman: slender jian — never swapped, never duplicated.\n\n[SCENE]\nA vast shan-shui landscape: towering misty karst peaks, a still green lake in the middle ground, a shallow rocky shore in the foreground where the two fight; thin morning mist drifts between mountains; a few tall pines at the water edge; pale early-morning sky. No buildings, no other people.\n\n[SHOT TIMELINE]\n0.0–1.5 seconds — Wide framing by the water: the two face each other on the wet stones; the man in black raises his dark blade in a slow cold arc; the woman in teal answers with her jian level, skirts settling; mist curls at their feet.\n1.5–3.5 seconds — They close and clash mid-stride, blades ringing with glinting sparks; the woman spins low with her pleated skirt flaring, the man counters with a heavy sweeping block; water droplets kick up from the shallow shore.\n3.5–5.0 seconds — They break apart and settle into guarded stances a few paces apart, blades raised toward each other, breath visible in the cool air; mist drifts between them; hold the standoff.\n\n[DIALOGUE AND LIP SYNC]\nNone — no spoken lines, no lip movement.\n\n[ACTING]\nThe man fights cold and ruthless, every motion efficient and heavy; the woman fights calm and precise, light-footed; both keep focused combat expressions throughout.\n\n[CAMERA]\n16:9 cinematic framing; wide distance keeping both fighters fully readable; one slow lateral tracking move during the clash; no whip pans, no cuts, no zoom pumping, no disorienting shake; mountains and water stay visible in the background throughout.\n\n[LIGHT AND IMAGE]\nSoft cool morning light with pale silver rim light on hair, black gauze and gold embroidery; mist catches gentle god rays between peaks; clean transparent image, filmic highlight rolloff, Arri Alexa-like color science, low-saturation cool grade, fine subtle film grain; live-action realistic wuxia drama look — not anime, not 3D, not CG.\n\n[PRODUCTION SOUND]\nClear metallic blade-clash rings, whooshing fabric and blade cuts, quick footwork on wet stone, a soft splash as droplets scatter; thin wind through pines and distant water lapping as ambience. No music, no dialogue, no voice-over.\n\n[CONTINUITY]\nBoth characters keep the exact faces, hairstyles, costumes and weapons of their reference sheets for the whole shot; the man's forehead mark and crack lines remain visible and unchanged; the woman's hairpins stay fixed; the landscape, mist and light stay consistent.\n\n[NEGATIVES]\nNo identity drift from either reference sheet, no face swap between the two characters, no extra fighters, no subtitles, no on-screen text, no narration, no background music, no song, no anime / 3D / CG look, no teleporting or floaty weightless motion, no limbs passing through bodies, no duplicated or vanishing weapons, no deformed hands or faces, no flickering costumes, no missing forehead mark mid-shot, no oversaturation, no watermark, no logo, no gore."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1505.8319091796875, 6031.60498046875], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.29.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [261], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "浮点"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [5], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveFloat", "title": "Float (Duration)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [270, 70], "pos": [-1490.2813720703125, 5852.275390625], "id": 132, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.29.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connect